"<command>configure</command> command below, you must also have <xref "
"linkend=\"perl-sgmlspm\"/> and <xref linkend=\"texlive\"/> installed, or the"
" <application>Fontconfig</application> build will fail."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Fontconfig"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fontconfig</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>./configure --prefix=/usr        \\\n"
"            --sysconfdir=/etc    \\\n"
"            --localstatedir=/var \\\n"
"            --disable-docs       \\\n"
"            --docdir=/usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>make check</command>.  One test is "
"known to fail if the kernel does not support user namespaces.  Some tests "
"will download some font files via Internet."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:135
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:138
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>make install</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:141
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you did not remove the <parameter>--disable-docs</parameter> parameter "
"from the <command>configure</command> command, you can install the pre-"
"generated documentation by using the following commands as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:147
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 \\\n"
"        /usr/share/{man/man{1,3,5},doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;} &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 fc-*/*.1         /usr/share/man/man1 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.3          /usr/share/man/man3 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/fonts-conf.5 /usr/share/man/man5 &amp;&amp;\n"
"install -v -m644 doc/*.{pdf,sgml,txt,html} \\\n"
"                                  /usr/share/doc/fontconfig-&fontconfig-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:158
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/blfs-git/general/graphlib/fontconfig.xml:161
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--disable-docs</parameter>: This switch avoids building the "
"documentation (the release tarball includes pre-generated documentation)."
msgstr ""

